## LinkedIn

- Scar in the first two lines. Technique name is optional and never the title.
- One URL. One question. No series numbering.
- Post Inspector on new URLs.
- If the evening window is missed, the next morning 8:30–9:30 AM IST is allowed **once** for that post. Then return to Tue/Thu evenings.
